Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.57,Live,,0,0,0,,●  LIVE RECORDING  ·  2026-11-08  ·  REAL TIME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:04.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,A new session on the public instance, recorded start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:12.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,The task: build a to-do app, test it in a real browser, attach a screenshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:16.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Its own gVisor box. It writes the app and starts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:21.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Flask is missing, so it installs it and retries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:31.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it drives a real browser in the box: adds “Buy milk”, checks it off, takes a screenshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:43.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,Done in 19 s: 12 model calls on Vultr for $0.0025. The screenshot comes back with the answer.
